//　そして、それと糸一筋で危うく均衡を取っているか
//のような、感慨――
  I want to pinch my cheek to see if I'm dreaming. And yet, at the same time, another thought rises to form a precarious balance within me.

//　美しい。
//　いたたまれぬほどに、美しい。
  Beautiful.<K>
  The machine is heart-<br>wrenchingly beautiful.

//　円周率を無理矢理解き明かして形容したかのような
//流線型のフォルム。
//　そこにメタリックブルーのカラーリングが重なれば、
//それは無限の海であり果てなき空だ。
  Its form is sleek and curved: what might emerge, perhaps, were a deranged mathematician to express pi in tsurugi form. Add to that the metallic blue paint, and you have a machine that calls to mind the fathomless sea and the infinite sky.

//　異界の美。
//　あってはならないもの。
//　禁忌の芸巧。

//　今――
//　そんな代物が、サーキットに立っている。
  Was it truly fashioned by the hands of men? Its beauty seems almost㉓<I>profane,</I>㉒the product of some strange world governed by unknown laws.

  Yet here it stands, in ours.

//　――騎体名<k>〝<RUBY text='アベンジ'>逆襲</RUBY>〟
 
 
 
 
 
           Crux:<K> "Avenger"

